# Patterns to ignore when packaging the chart.
.DS_Store
.git/
.gitignore
*.swp
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
# The values files below exist for the repository's own verification and are not part of what an operator installs.
ci/
# Artifact Hub reads this from a reserved tag in the chart's OCI repository, which the release run pushes it to. It
# says who owns a listing rather than anything about the deployment, so it does not travel inside the package.
artifacthub-repo.yml
